    description: "Five languages with high production deployment popularity but surprisingly low analyzer maturity (measured by git commit count as proxy). Swift (13 commits, Tier 4 in qualitative review), Objective-C (10), Erlang (8), Haskell (6), Scala (16). Each needs a targeted DEEP bakeoff curriculum (2-4 cohorts, 2-4 repos per cohort) to surface analyzer gaps and drive improvement. See discussion for a researcher prompt that can generate these curricula."  # c6af
